WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:06.500
Your diary shows the next two weeks: booked, on hold, and offered.

2
00:00:06.750 --> 00:00:10.900
Producers only ever see Available, Pencilled or Booked.

3
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:16.900
Answer an offer with I'm in, Hold it, or Not this time.

4
00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:22.500
If you have an agent, their offers come through here too.

5
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:31.701
Bookings keeps every job, hold and pencil in one list. And there's no commission, ever.

